# The one credential this project uses. Two commands read it, both run by
# hand, both committing what they produce:
#
#   rag-contract build-index     embeds the corpus and the question set
#   rag-contract record-drafts   records the answer model's claims as fixtures
#
# Everything else — the evals, the gate, CI — runs off those committed
# artefacts and needs no key at all.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

DAILY_SPEND_CAP_USD=2.00
